WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.010
Pick a scenario. Everything shown here is
synthetic demo data.

2
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:14.310
Starting creates a private demo workspace,
already loaded with sample data.

3
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:23.560
New reports arrive as raw text,
spreadsheets and documents.

4
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:31.420
One click runs AI extraction. No outside
model is needed for this demo.

5
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:38.460
The raw report becomes structured fields,
each with a confidence score.

6
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:47.920
Anything uncertain goes to a person.
Original text on the left, evidence on the
right.

7
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:54.960
A human confirms the fact, so it can be
trusted.

8
00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:04.070
A fixed rule checks the facts and fires.
Every condition it tested is shown.

9
00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:12.120
A case is opened automatically, with an
owner, priority and evidence.

10
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:19.810
The follow-up actions are already
assigned.

11
00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:29.010
The system proposes an action but never
acts alone. High-risk choices need a
person.

12
00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:37.670
The approver records why, in their own
words.

13
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:45.220
Approved, and recorded.

14
00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:53.040
The dashboards update from that single
approval.

15
00:01:53.040 --> 00:02:00.600
Every step is kept in an audit trail, in
order.

16
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:07.350
Same flow, applied to your own operations.
